S1Q20

Looking at the activity on Anne's machine, we see the threat actor saved the result of their commands to a .csv files, then archived it before exfiltrating it. Maybe you even recognise the IP address used for that exfiltration 😉

What password did they set for the archived documents?

ProcessEvents
| where timestamp >= datetime(10/25/2025, 7:56:03 AM)
| where process_commandline contains ("7z")
| where username contains "anbonny"
//| where hostname has_any ("DC_offices", "DC_warehouses", "EWSI-LAPTOP")
| order by timestamp asc


7z.exe a -p br@!nz pss.7z .\remoteps.csv

//password  == br@!nz


