adrecon.txt
This suggests they were preparing for lateral movement.


3. Persistence: creating a new account

This is the biggest clue:

net user orka Lev14Th4n /add
net localgroup administrators orka /add

They created:

Username: orka
Password: Lev14Th4n

and added it to:

Local Administrators

This is persistence.

This output is probably before the final tool step.

/////Use the suspicious user orka as a pivot.

ProcessEvents
| where hostname contains "HT1Z-DESKTOP"
| where timestamp > datetime(2025-09-24T06:02:58Z)
| where username has_any ("dajones","orka")
| project timestamp, username, process_name, process_commandline
| order by timestamp asc
| distinct process_commandline

